                        "params": {
                            "fontSize": 12,
                            "markdown": "### Step 1 \u2014 Elastic Cloud & Cluster API Keys\nConfigure shared credentials in **Kibana \u2192 Fleet \u2192 Agent Policies \u2192 Chargeback \u2192 Elastic Cloud & Deployment Access**:\n\n- **`organization_id` & `cloud_api_key`**: Elastic Cloud API key with **Billing Admin** role and Cloud deployment / Serverless project read access.\n- **`deployment_api_keys`** *(optional)*: Least-privileged ES API keys (`<deployment_id_or_name>:<encoded_key>`) for harvesting remote ECH clusters.\n- **`hub_es_url` & `hub_es_api_key`** *(optional)*: Local Monitoring / Hub cluster endpoint and key (also enables Cross-Cluster Search fallback `<cluster_name>:*`).\n- **Deployment grouping**: Tag deployments in Cloud Console with `chargeback_group:<team_name>` to group spend by tenant.",
