                        "params": {
                            "fontSize": 12,
                            "markdown": "### Step 2 \u2014 Per-Data-Stream UI Settings\nAll currency rates, credit commitments, and cost/utilization weights are managed directly inside each data stream's UI config in **Fleet** (no manual lookup index edits):\n\n- **Elastic Cloud Daily Billing (`chargeback.billing`)**: `Billing Lookbehind Days`, `Currency Unit` (e.g. `EUR`, `USD`), `Chargeable Unit Rate`, and `Collect ESS Credit Commitment Data`.\n- **Elastic Cloud Daily Index & Tier Usage (`chargeback.usage`)**: `Blended Indexing / Query / Storage Weights` and `Memory / Storage Cost Split Weights`.\n- **Elastic Cloud Data Node Utilization (`chargeback.node_stats`)**: `Utilization Memory (Heap p95) / Storage (Disk p95) Weights` and `Utilization Floor`.",
