                        "description": "",
                        "id": "",
                        "params": {
                            "fontSize": 12,
                            "markdown": "### Step 3 \u2014 Automatic Transforms & Stock Symlinks\nChargeback runs self-contained collection and continuous `5m` transforms automatically:\n\n- **Lookup sync**: Saving changes in the Fleet Data Stream UI automatically refreshes the three collection streams and updates all 8 `lookup`-mode indices (including `chargeback_conf_lookup`).\n- **Stock dashboard symlinks**: Index aliases (`metrics-ess_billing.billing-chargeback`, `metrics-ess_billing.credits-chargeback`, `monitoring-indices`) allow stock **ESS Billing** and **Elasticsearch Consumption** dashboards to run without duplicate collection policies \u2014 install their **Assets** only under **Management \u2192 Integrations**.",
